+no view (structuredClone transfer)                     detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+one Float32Array view (structuredClone transfer)       detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+one view, postMessage transfer list (lodWorker-style)  detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+one view, ArrayBuffer.prototype.transfer               detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+two TypedArray views (Uint8Array + Float32Array)       detached true   probe before true  after false  deoptimized true   traced: ArrayBufferDetaching (DedicatedWorker thread)
+two views of one kind (2x Float32Array)                detached true   probe before true  after false  deoptimized true   traced: ArrayBufferDetaching (DedicatedWorker thread)
+one DataView                                           detached true   probe before true  after false  deoptimized true   traced: ArrayBufferDetaching (DedicatedWorker thread)
+wasm memory.grow, no view                              detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+wasm memory.grow, one view                             detached true   probe before true  after true   deoptimized false  traced: -
+wasm memory.grow, two views                            detached true   probe before true  after false  deoptimized true   traced: ArrayBufferDetaching (DedicatedWorker thread)
